WEBVTT

00:00:01.760 --> 00:00:05.720
I dare you to lay one finger on them!
I'll rip your head off, boy!

00:00:08.180 --> 00:00:09.760
That's telling him, Captain.

00:00:10.760 --> 00:00:14.340
The joint front between the Nahel Argama
and Neo Zeon breaks down,

00:00:14.380 --> 00:00:17.380
and as a fierce battle erupts,

00:00:17.430 --> 00:00:20.220
Banagher finds Full Frontal
and confronts him.

00:00:21.050 --> 00:00:24.180
How would you use Laplace's Box?

00:00:25.220 --> 00:00:27.220
For everyone.

00:00:27.300 --> 00:00:29.300
I'd use it for everyone.

00:00:29.340 --> 00:00:33.260
Not for the Federation, for Zeon,
for space, or for Earth.

00:00:33.300 --> 00:00:35.550
I'd use Laplace's Box for everyone!

00:00:36.510 --> 00:00:40.630
Mineva, who rejects Full Frontal's plan
for a Side Co-Prosperity Sphere,

00:00:40.680 --> 00:00:43.720
rescues Banagher with Marida's assistance.

00:00:44.260 --> 00:00:49.680
The ever loyal Zeon, Zinnerman
orders Marida to surrender, but...

00:00:49.720 --> 00:00:52.050
Reason can't make them go away.

00:00:52.630 --> 00:00:53.880
The hatred...

00:00:54.760 --> 00:00:55.930
The regret...

00:00:57.380 --> 00:00:58.880
F-Father.

00:00:59.430 --> 00:01:02.930
Will you let me have my way
this one time?

00:01:04.050 --> 00:01:09.340
This is my final order to you.
Listen to your heart.

00:01:10.300 --> 00:01:11.220
Understood.

00:01:12.340 --> 00:01:14.840
Zinnerman, you bastard!

00:01:14.880 --> 00:01:16.680
From here on out, it's a race.

00:01:16.930 --> 00:01:19.430
I have the perfect solution
for this situation.

00:01:19.470 --> 00:01:22.510
Now, the battle revolving
around Laplace's Box

00:01:22.550 --> 00:01:23.800
is entering its final stage,

00:01:23.840 --> 00:01:28.220
at Industrial 7,
the place where it all began.

00:01:33.010 --> 00:01:34.550
This is the Captain speaking.

00:01:35.880 --> 00:01:38.930
We are now on a course
to Industrial 7

00:01:39.590 --> 00:01:42.930
to carry out a mission
to secure Laplace's Box.

00:01:44.180 --> 00:01:48.010
Although we may appear to have suddenly
returned to our original duties,

00:01:48.050 --> 00:01:51.300
this mission is not being conducted
on orders from the military.

00:01:52.180 --> 00:01:56.130
We are carrying it out
on our own in order to survive.

00:01:56.180 --> 00:02:00.510
In order to prevent the Box
from falling into Full Frontal's hands.

00:02:02.050 --> 00:02:06.260
The founding of a Side Co-Prosperity
Sphere as laid out by Full Frontal,

00:02:06.300 --> 00:02:09.880
or the future Princess Mineva speaks of
that is at the mercy of possibility?

00:02:10.680 --> 00:02:14.590
I don't know which
of these two is correct.

00:02:15.220 --> 00:02:18.510
We will not be the ones who decide,

00:02:18.550 --> 00:02:20.800
but rather the youths
who are alive right now

00:02:21.380 --> 00:02:25.220
and the children who are yet to be born.

00:02:25.720 --> 00:02:32.470
To entrust this choice to them,
we must return from this alive.

00:02:36.680 --> 00:02:39.220
We must return with Box in hand

00:02:39.260 --> 00:02:42.840
and confront the world with the truth!

00:02:54.470 --> 00:02:58.130
As a soldier... as an adult...

00:02:58.760 --> 00:03:01.300
I look forward to seeing you
fight bravely!

00:03:19.760 --> 00:03:23.260
Banagher Links, Unicorn Gundam,
taking off!

00:03:52.800 --> 00:03:54.220
I've come home...

00:03:54.970 --> 00:03:57.970
Thermal signature closing in
from 6 o'clock!

00:04:06.380 --> 00:04:09.180
It's a mobile suit!
Appears to be riding a Geta!

00:04:09.720 --> 00:04:11.930
It might have been dispatched
by the General Revil

00:04:11.970 --> 00:04:15.130
after they got a report
from that patrol ship.

00:04:15.430 --> 00:04:17.130
Why now?

00:04:17.180 --> 00:04:18.800
Disperse Minovsky particles!

00:04:18.840 --> 00:04:20.760
It's just one suit! Drive it off!

00:04:45.930 --> 00:04:47.720
It'll take more than
half-hearted potshots!

00:05:36.760 --> 00:05:38.930
Where's the Unicorn?!

00:05:56.010 --> 00:05:57.180
Ensign Riddhe...

00:05:59.380 --> 00:06:00.880
Banagher!

00:07:56.510 --> 00:08:01.300
(FATEFUL BATTLE)

00:09:04.840 --> 00:09:07.840
Tracking support ship Chitose,
pull back from line of fire.

00:09:07.880 --> 00:09:10.840
Earth Orbital Fleet, withdraw from
the specified sectors.

00:09:10.880 --> 00:09:12.970
System relocated
from behind Luna II.

00:09:13.010 --> 00:09:16.510
Commence attitude control. Resume
rotation and establish gyro stability.

00:09:16.550 --> 00:09:19.880
Targeting Guidance Control,
guide laser link established.

00:09:19.930 --> 00:09:22.880
System in firing position,
orientation procedure in progress.

00:09:22.930 --> 00:09:25.220
All generator satellites
tracking and reorienting.

00:09:25.260 --> 00:09:27.090
Worker vessels also in position.

00:09:27.130 --> 00:09:30.630
Ms. Martha, Chairman Ronan.
It's been too long.

00:09:33.630 --> 00:09:35.340
The Nahel Argama's position?

00:09:38.550 --> 00:09:43.510
It's currently engaging a Neo Zeon fleet
in the vicinity of Industrial 7.

00:09:43.550 --> 00:09:45.840
The special operations machine
launched from the General Revil

00:09:45.880 --> 00:09:47.760
has also arrived on the battle line.

00:09:51.800 --> 00:09:53.930
In the end, they're like oil and water.

00:09:53.970 --> 00:09:57.930
The Federation-Neo Zeon
marriage has broken up.

00:09:57.970 --> 00:09:59.590
Chairman Ronan.

00:10:00.630 --> 00:10:02.430
It's just as we heard.

00:10:02.470 --> 00:10:05.300
It is clear that Laplace's Box

00:10:05.340 --> 00:10:08.050
is located within
Industrial 7's Magallanica.

00:10:10.720 --> 00:10:13.760
When either one of them reaches it...

00:10:19.550 --> 00:10:21.550
The line of fire is clear, sir.

00:10:21.590 --> 00:10:22.760
Give the order at any time.

00:10:25.970 --> 00:10:30.930
With this, Laplace's Box will be lost,
and a new Box will be born.

00:10:32.130 --> 00:10:37.720
Which is the heinous truth that we kept
the secret at the cost of a colony.

00:10:38.430 --> 00:10:41.840
The new Box will allow
the collusion between

00:10:41.880 --> 00:10:44.220
the Foundation and
government to continue.

00:10:50.630 --> 00:10:52.380
Did you say Gryps 2?!

00:10:52.430 --> 00:10:53.970
Its codename is "System".

00:10:54.470 --> 00:10:58.470
Apparently, it was repaired when they
reorganized the Earth Orbital Fleet.

00:10:58.970 --> 00:11:04.930
They say the control center is
at Cheyenne in North America.

00:11:04.970 --> 00:11:09.720
And if Federation and Vist Foundation
top brass have gathered there...

00:11:10.050 --> 00:11:12.180
They intend to incinerate everything?

00:11:12.430 --> 00:11:13.930
That's my guess.

00:11:13.970 --> 00:11:17.130
The Foundation doesn't care about
preserving the Box anymore.

00:11:17.180 --> 00:11:20.380
Before they see it handed over
to a third party, they'd rather- -

00:11:20.430 --> 00:11:24.720
The Nahel Argama is in battle, and I have
no means of warning them of the danger.

00:11:24.760 --> 00:11:27.550
Issue an evacuation
recommendation for Industrial 7.

00:11:27.590 --> 00:11:29.630
It might be too late, but...

00:11:29.680 --> 00:11:31.970
It's tough to be you, Capt. Bright.

00:11:32.010 --> 00:11:33.130
All hands!

00:11:33.840 --> 00:11:35.760
Prepare for atmospheric entry!

00:11:36.260 --> 00:11:38.930
We will now descend to Earth!

00:12:53.220 --> 00:12:57.300
They added more psycho-frames,
so why won't the NT-D activate?!

00:12:57.340 --> 00:13:00.880
Please get out of that black Unicorn!
Get out of the Banshee right away!

00:13:00.930 --> 00:13:02.760
It's a dangerous machine!

00:13:02.800 --> 00:13:03.930
Shut up!

00:13:04.220 --> 00:13:08.380
Leading units have made contact with
enemy mobile suits! Now engaging!

00:13:08.430 --> 00:13:09.840
Unicorn's status?

00:13:09.880 --> 00:13:12.180
Still engaging the enemy 150 km aft!

00:13:12.220 --> 00:13:13.760
ECOAS Team, EC-01,

00:13:13.800 --> 00:13:17.380
Mega Bazooka Launcher connected
to main gun power supply and in position.

00:13:17.430 --> 00:13:19.760
Roger. Preparations complete
for anti-air combat!

00:13:19.800 --> 00:13:20.930
Open fire!

00:14:09.760 --> 00:14:11.300
Romeo-011 heavily damaged!

00:14:11.340 --> 00:14:14.630
Enemy suits have breached defense line!
Approaching at high speed!

00:14:14.680 --> 00:14:17.220
We've been located?
Anti-air interception!

00:14:28.590 --> 00:14:29.970
Is he ramming us?

00:14:46.760 --> 00:14:50.010
We don't have time for this!
Frontal will- -

00:14:50.050 --> 00:14:52.010
If it weren't for you- -

00:15:05.430 --> 00:15:07.510
The Unicorn and Banshee
are pulling at each other!

00:15:07.840 --> 00:15:09.590
I can't hold it back any longer!

00:15:11.050 --> 00:15:13.430
Are you saying
you've been holding back?

00:15:15.630 --> 00:15:20.930
How miserable are you going to
make me before you're satisfied?

00:15:26.260 --> 00:15:27.510
Mr. Riddhe, don't!

00:15:52.470 --> 00:15:54.430
Take a good look at the situation!

00:15:54.470 --> 00:15:56.590
There's no reason
for us to be fighting here!

00:15:56.630 --> 00:15:58.840
I have a duty to keep you people away

00:15:58.880 --> 00:16:00.260
- Is that that ensign?
- from Laplace's Box,

00:16:00.300 --> 00:16:02.680
- Why are the Gundams fighting each other?
- both as a Federation officer

00:16:02.720 --> 00:16:04.340
and as a member of the Marcenas family!

00:16:04.380 --> 00:16:06.090
That's a lie, Ensign Riddhe! You're- -

00:16:06.130 --> 00:16:08.180
- Ensign Riddhe? Why is he- -
- Shut up! A kid like you

00:16:08.220 --> 00:16:09.760
got full of yourself
because you are a Newtype

00:16:09.800 --> 00:16:12.840
and made a mess of everything!
I can't let you get away with it!

00:16:13.220 --> 00:16:16.010
New enemies detected! Company size!

00:16:16.050 --> 00:16:17.630
Rose mobile suit confirmed, as well!

00:16:18.800 --> 00:16:20.470
Lt. Angelo?

00:16:26.880 --> 00:16:31.050
The Captain, the King of the Dispossessed,
is the only one worthy to hold the Box!

00:16:31.090 --> 00:16:33.970
You ignorant fools
don't comprehend that...

00:16:34.010 --> 00:16:37.090
You people are a blight!
And I'll get rid of you all!

00:17:21.930 --> 00:17:23.800
FCS circuits have been cut!

00:17:24.130 --> 00:17:26.010
I'll head down to Fire Control!

00:17:31.630 --> 00:17:32.930
Bridge.

00:17:33.300 --> 00:17:36.010
This is Marida Cruz.
Launching in the Kshatriya.

00:17:37.380 --> 00:17:38.630
Captain!

00:17:41.510 --> 00:17:43.430
Stop her, Ensign Mihiro!

00:17:44.380 --> 00:17:47.180
She's still in no shape to fight.

00:17:47.220 --> 00:17:48.470
Right, sir?

00:17:55.430 --> 00:17:57.010
Let her go.

00:18:01.180 --> 00:18:02.260
Zinnerman?

00:18:07.630 --> 00:18:12.590
We'll position the Kshatriya to our rear
and keep the black Gundam occupied.

00:18:12.630 --> 00:18:16.180
Then we can send the Unicorn to
deal with the enemies up ahead.

00:18:16.220 --> 00:18:18.340
But Lt. Marida isn't- -

00:18:18.380 --> 00:18:20.510
If we do nothing, we'll all
be killed anyway.

00:18:21.130 --> 00:18:24.050
We'll deploy the firepower
of the Full Armor ahead of us

00:18:24.090 --> 00:18:25.090
to punch our way through.

00:18:25.880 --> 00:18:29.260
In the meantime, we'll determine
the enemy mother ship's position

00:18:29.300 --> 00:18:31.180
from the mobile suits' trajectory data.

00:18:31.220 --> 00:18:33.550
While the Unicorn has the attention
of all the enemy's forces,

00:18:33.590 --> 00:18:37.510
we hit them with the mega particle cannon
and sink the Rewloola's escort ships.

00:18:41.220 --> 00:18:44.090
Marida, you heard the plan.

00:18:44.130 --> 00:18:45.510
Are you up for it?

00:18:46.590 --> 00:18:47.550
Yes.

00:18:48.380 --> 00:18:53.010
Don't overdo it. Neither you nor
the Kshatriya are at 100%.

00:18:53.050 --> 00:18:54.380
I know.

00:18:56.800 --> 00:18:57.720
Thank you.

00:19:01.090 --> 00:19:03.180
Kshatriya! Launching!

00:19:20.300 --> 00:19:21.470
Captain.

00:19:24.050 --> 00:19:26.010
Take the Chief Gunnery Officer's seat.

00:19:26.050 --> 00:19:27.180
Captain!

00:19:27.470 --> 00:19:31.050
I need a combat advisor.
Is that all right with you?

00:19:33.720 --> 00:19:34.630
Yes!

00:19:47.050 --> 00:19:48.550
Newtypes...

00:19:49.300 --> 00:19:53.010
The subspecies of humanity that embodies
the curse of Laplace's Box...

00:19:53.050 --> 00:19:56.720
Someone has to be made into a
human sacrifice to exorcise it!

00:20:05.880 --> 00:20:09.760
The Marcenas family placed the curse,
and the Vist Foundation kept it hidden.

00:20:10.380 --> 00:20:13.090
As the heirs to each,
if we both disappear,

00:20:13.130 --> 00:20:15.760
so will the karma of
the past 100 years!

00:20:15.800 --> 00:20:17.380
Are you serious?

00:20:17.430 --> 00:20:20.010
It wasn't supposed to be this way!

00:20:20.050 --> 00:20:23.010
It wasn't a curse, it was a prayer!

00:20:23.050 --> 00:20:26.050
If only you Newtypes hadn't come along!

00:20:34.050 --> 00:20:37.340
Calm down, Mr. Riddhe! You're being
swallowed by the machine!

00:20:37.380 --> 00:20:39.380
So what if I am?!

00:20:47.180 --> 00:20:50.510
I'm trying to destroy a new
space-adapted human race!

00:20:50.550 --> 00:20:52.340
Selling my soul to a machine
is a small price!

00:20:52.380 --> 00:20:56.970
No! Mr. Riddhe, you don't understand!
You're a Newtype, too!

00:20:57.090 --> 00:21:00.760
This light from the psycho-frame,
it's coming from inside of you!

00:21:00.800 --> 00:21:01.760
What?

00:21:01.800 --> 00:21:05.550
You should be able to hear it, too!
Everyone is worried about you.

00:21:06.050 --> 00:21:08.590
Even Audrey. And Ensign Mihiro
and the others!

00:21:13.550 --> 00:21:15.470
Stop talking!

00:21:25.590 --> 00:21:26.760
What was that?!

00:21:28.840 --> 00:21:29.930
Ms. Marida!

00:21:29.970 --> 00:21:31.800
I'll deal with this one.

00:21:31.840 --> 00:21:34.260
You clear a path for the Nahel Argama!

00:21:39.130 --> 00:21:40.300
But you're...!

00:21:45.760 --> 00:21:47.340
You're in my way! Get going!

00:21:58.260 --> 00:21:59.470
Don't try to interfere!

00:22:04.340 --> 00:22:05.970
Move it!

00:23:38.260 --> 00:23:41.260
Next time, on Mobile Suit Gundam Unicorn

00:23:41.300 --> 00:23:43.840
ANOTHER COSMIC GLOW

00:23:45.050 --> 00:23:48.380
awaken the Newtype that lies within you.
